estionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Mon, Oct 12th @ 9:32 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:15</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
